<title>JAPAN: Kyushu Fujisash - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kyushu Fujisash - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 13.30		vs	   13.05</p>
<p> Operating	  591    million	  vs	  511    million</p>
<p> Current	    566    million	  vs	  306    million</p>
<p> Net		  316    million	  vs	  173    million</p>
<p> EPS		   29.34 yen	  vs	   16.86 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     11 million	  vs	  11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kyushu Fujisash Co Ltd is the full company name.</p>
